#: inc/admin/pages/vs-pro.php:269
msgid "Style Kits"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin/pages/vs-pro.php:271
msgid "Instantly change the aesthetic of your site with our color schemes and style kits. Each kit is a professionally curated palette of colors, fonts, and styles that can be applied to your website with a single click."
